<section class="py-20 bg-zinc-950 border-t border-b border-amber-500/10 relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Visual Card -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm rounded-3xl p-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-900 to-black border border-amber-500/30 text-center shadow-2xl">
          <!-- Logo Badge Emblem -->
          <div class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto rounded-full bg-black border-2 border-amber-400 p-1 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-full border border-amber-500/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-amber-400">BR</span>
              <span class="text-[8px] tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-400 font-bold">Herbal</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">BlackRoots India</h4>
          <p class="text-amber-400 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold mb-4">Japanese Inspired Hair Care</p>
          <div class="gold-divider my-4"></div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed italic">
            "Combining centuries of Japanese botanical hair care wisdom with powerful Indian Ayurvedic herbal science."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Story Text -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <span class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Our Philosophy</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
          Rooted in Nature, <br>
          <span class="gold-gradient-text">Inspired by Japanese Hair Rituals</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-gray-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 font-light">
          For generations, Japanese hair rituals relied on cold-pressed Camellia seed oils, natural plant-based pigments, and deep herbal scalps rinses to preserve rich dark hair luster well into older age.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
          At **BlackRoots**, we combined these Japanese botanical traditions with proven Indian active herbs (Amla, Shikakai, Bhringraj, Brahmi). The result is a dermatologically tested, chemical-free herbal hair dye shampoo that gently restores natural black hair tones while eliminating dandruff and stopping hair fall.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <div>
            <span class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-amber-400 block">100%</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Natural Actives</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-amber-400 block">250 ml</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Net Volume</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

